1
00:01:37,777 --> 00:01:43,777
A Paw Patrol Christmas is a animation, family,
adventure film directed by Jamie Whitney.

2
00:03:15,555 --> 00:03:21,555
Rubble is looking forward to Santa bringing him a new laser drill, but finds that
Santa has come down with a cold and can’t deliver any presents.

3
00:04:53,333 --> 00:04:59,333
When Mayor Humdinger decides he’s going to the North Pole to take all the
gifts for himself, it’s up to the PAW Patrol to stop him.

4
00:06:31,111 --> 00:06:37,111
Chase (voice), played by Luke Dietz.

5
00:08:08,888 --> 00:08:14,888
Skye (voice), played by Lilly Bartlam.

6
00:09:46,666 --> 00:09:52,666
Rubble (voice), played by Lucien Duncan-Reid.

7
00:11:24,444 --> 00:11:30,444
Marshall (voice), played by Jesse Gervasi.

8
00:13:02,222 --> 00:13:08,222
Lizzy (voice), played by Courtney Gilmour.

9
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:46,000
Ryder (voice), played by Kai Harris.

10
00:16:17,777 --> 00:16:23,777
Paw Patrol (stylized as PAW Patrol) is a Canadian children's animated television series created by Keith
Chapman and produced by Spin Master Entertainment, with animation provided by Guru Studio.

11
00:17:55,555 --> 00:18:01,555
In Canada, the series is primarily broadcast on TVOntario
as part of the TVOKids programing block.

12
00:19:33,333 --> 00:19:39,333
TVO first ran previews of the show in August 2013.

13
00:21:11,111 --> 00:21:17,111
The series premiered on Nickelodeon's Nick Jr.

14
00:22:48,888 --> 00:22:54,888
in the United States on August 12, 2013.

15
00:24:26,666 --> 00:24:32,666
The series focuses on a young boy named Ryder who leads a crew of
search and rescue dogs that call themselves the Paw Patrol.

16
00:26:04,444 --> 00:26:10,444
They work together on missions to protect the shoreside
community of Adventure Bay and surrounding areas.

17
00:27:42,222 --> 00:27:48,222
Each dog has a specific set of skills based on emergency services professions,
such as a firefighter, a police officer, and an aviation pilot.

18
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:26,000
They all reside in doghouses that transform into customized
vehicles or "pupmobiles" for their missions.

19
00:30:57,777 --> 00:31:03,777
They are also equipped with special hi-tech backpacks called "pup
packs" that contain tools relating to their respective job.

20
00:32:35,555 --> 00:32:41,555
Since its debut, the series has developed into a media franchise, generating millions of dollars in revenue from
toy sales for Spin Master and has increased the company's presence in the preschool toy market.

21
00:34:13,333 --> 00:34:19,333
The franchise includes a feature film which released in August 2021, followed by a sequel, The Mighty Movie, on September 29, 2023, another upcoming sequel The Dino Movie,
set to be released on July 31, 2026, and a spin-off series based on one of the show's main characters titled Rubble & Crew which premiered in February 2023.

22
00:35:51,111 --> 00:35:57,111
The show celebrated its 10th anniversary in 2023.

23
00:37:28,888 --> 00:37:34,888
The show, and its associated products, have received a variety of awards and nominations from associations such
as the Academy of Canadian Cinema & Television and the Academy of Television Arts & Sciences.

24
00:39:06,666 --> 00:39:12,666
The series is currently on its twelfth season, which began airing in July 2025.

25
00:40:44,444 --> 00:40:50,444
In early February 2023, series creator Keith Chapman said in an interview with The Hollywood Reporter
magazine that the series could still be on television for another ten years or more.

26
00:42:22,222 --> 00:42:28,222
The film explores themes of cartoon, rescue
mission, dog, rescue team, cartoon dog.
